"🐢 bummer dude...

🐚 git.stage.add
   └─ ✋ ConstraintError: globally blocked

🥥 did you know?
   ├─ a human has blocked all mechanic operations; ask them to lift it
   └─ git.commit.uses allow --global
"
`;

